<title>CROATIA: Croatian Aug jobless unchanged at 18.2 pct vs July.</title>
<headline>Croatian Aug jobless unchanged at 18.2 pct vs July.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics and Ministry of Labour issued the following details.</p>
<p> CROATIA UNEMPLOYMENT	 AUGUST	 JULY	  AUG '95</p>
<p> Total unemployed	     256,091     257,133	232,903</p>
<p> Unemployment rate (pct)     18.2	  18.2	   16.5</p>
<p>NOTES -- Total workforce figures are being constantly revised to include private sector but they exclude army, police and farmers. Data exclude unemployed in Serb-held territory. -- Kolumbina Bencevic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
